{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定」發售！皮克敏新周邊也登場\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/15f992727c286a11ce5db9617ad75f7569d8626313bb1a20e3d87dfc1a2c5022/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F521136fa2ad0e2eb4e5398d90f83b201.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定」發售！皮克敏新周邊也登場</figcaption></figure><p><strong>任天堂</strong>發售了Nintendo Switch 2軟體「<strong>皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定</strong>」。<br/>公開了小芝風花挑戰安排檢定的體驗影片，皮克敏的新周邊也登場。</p><h2>「皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定」發售！體驗版也發布中</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>「<a href=\"https://www.nintendo.com/jp/games/switch2/ampyc/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定</a>」是在Nintendo Switch發售的「皮克敏4」加上新要素及Nintendo Switch 2獨有玩法的軟體。<br/>在新玩法「<strong>大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定</strong>」中，可挑戰於 每週五・六・日 舉辦的正式檢定。</p><p></p><p>對應以Switch 2本體麥克風向搭檔歐慶呼喚的「<strong>汪指令</strong>」，以及安排對戰的「分享通訊」。<br/>畫面也更加鮮明漂亮。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h3>公開小芝風花挑戰安排檢定的體驗影片</h3><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>公開了小芝風花挑戰安排檢定的長篇<a href=\"https://youtu.be/2D6mauen6jI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">體驗影片</a>。<br/>30秒的<a href=\"https://youtu.be/x9Nuq-5-dfU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">廣告</a>版也已公開。</p><h3>體驗版也能報考安排檢定</h3><figure><img alt=\"皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定 體驗版\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/13090c7bf3daaf5ff8f9fcfa9777e1667229bf553e789c9c332bfa40f3dc9346/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe269daa705d61a63c0c35070691e02fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定 體驗版</figcaption></figure><p>體驗版中，除了本篇序盤的「暖陽庭園」之外，還能享受了解安排檢定基礎的「入門關卡」及部分檢定關卡。<br/>與製品版相同，每週末也能報考安排檢定。</p><figure><img alt=\"在體驗版報考安排檢定可獲得的明信片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"644\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c16a1f0a5c385977b47162617bbf7ef5f500d2d3cc5ff4fcaa0d8676703e9d5a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff50d0ee85fdc60181f37f348741bea6a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>在體驗版報考安排檢定可獲得的明信片</figcaption></figure><p>在體驗版報考安排檢定，即可獲得智慧型手機應用程式「Pikmin Bloom」的<strong>明信片</strong>。<br/>另外，相同明信片在製品版達成「在故事中首次查看第2天以後的探索結果」時也能獲得。<br/>此外，在全國遊戲賣場的店頭試玩台，可遊玩「暖陽庭園」的探索及安排檢定關卡「巨型蘑菇挑戰」。</p><h3>「Nintendo Today！」介紹大師獎牌的獲得路線</h3><p>2026年12月以後，智慧型手機應用程式「Nintendo Today！」預定介紹能獲得安排檢定最高評價「<strong>大師獎牌</strong>」的路線範例。<br/>覺得無論挑戰幾次都很難的人，不妨參考看看。</p><h2>皮克敏新周邊與軟體同日發售！</h2><figure><img alt=\"以在室內生活的皮克敏們為意象的周邊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b72a7640a5df57c83866f3c5601d1f04d3afacb6770c9ca67b982929449932f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F64798a1f1f759b0bc68de36c6580dc86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>以在室內生活的皮克敏們為意象的周邊</figcaption></figure><p>以在室內生活的皮克敏們為意象的色彩繽紛周邊，以<strong>全8種</strong>陣容登場。<br/>設計了搬運各種東西的皮克敏，以及打扮奇特的裝飾皮克敏。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/be234f6936c29fb4bdd1a9d2e6bc229de6c69854af45616f3aa4d9a13a9f864d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe8567397791f6f84fb929b2707278cb2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/87426e80758e2f4b79dad87b3101fe4517519b37bbc6931ea85541239186a397/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff58a03b7dbfe17ee81edf3667f6840a5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/19a72e7785a3e04f47d8f47e50cb41761950a14b8267bb7031979523d2b47597/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6009ce3794e1baff5c06d21ea1a88191.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-07.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/045d0c483533f5cf529e5087cd4fa909ffa2563ffd389e6e6a3125c8913d7f3a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa8b72a68690ad5f8bacd7960cf253732.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d78c39c14ef91d71b3ee4b52dc87abbd96f71c8cdb48c07021fd7410f2d42e91/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdfc30104870b75d899c4eb2d028c67a2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-09.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5104aacd2d9e7f6c2d872a8c7cd9c3c2e253691a26b905dbf2433589db2307ff/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa6c04aba64408032af31ff3f090029c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-10.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c7d08ec0e84fc80bc3eb996e3db7aa19c861ff9badda94cdb745ac464f727837/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9b2bf475c9c1d32eed9694aa5a5270b0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1061cdb31b6dd854a90aedad8566a3c9ddba0667d2baa81ba9b2cddb3d00e170/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbe0ccb3729114a0f93ed620951057399.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><ul><li><p>被拔起之城皮克敏磁鐵(全3種)：各1,870日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>馬克杯 PIKMIN(全3種)：各2,200日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>文具盒 PIKMIN：4,400日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>圍巾 PIKMIN：3,300日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>小碟組 PIKMIN 2件組(全3種)：各2,200日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>磁磚磁鐵收藏 PIKMIN(全9種)：單品990日圓(含稅)、BOX 8,910日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>抱枕套 PIKMIN：3,960日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>領帶 PIKMIN：4,400日圓(含稅)</p></li></ul><p>其他還有皮克敏與歐慶的周邊，以及推薦用於贈送軟體的包裝×環保袋等也在販售。</p><figure><img alt=\"斜背包(皮克敏)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b606623eb0f908c4a65a1cca5f98b1f4de66f08726a0b6f144e16781b752438a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffe6d4578dccc9fcad219ebf04a8427dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>斜背包(皮克敏)</figcaption></figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-13.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c589f72cd8fbba5e0d8a26497f1f37249ccd82effaf5c3f4725a5eb9d103bd3d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8d416407187de6437232175eaf48591c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-14.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a98683725ddfbfd250135b8f7b9cccdb9d54bc60123c7706cc9869a2732db58/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0842484e3edca2628f4e06531c814b17.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-15.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"699\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7f7b07b0c953d3875e23ebfc9c983cebb58afcfad109e5884026c343c567552e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0ac7baf2624da7b0fb66af326d39f7af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/pikmin4-nintendo-switch2-edition-16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"699\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/28ff350d9475b83af6e263670a2a7c239a3153aff319a7f7b1f9106e531cc68d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd14eb2f481b4e687e7797aa0974256b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><ul><li><p>斜背包(皮克敏)：2,750日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>IC卡套(皮克敏＆歐慶)：1,980日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>裝飾吊飾(皮克敏＆歐慶)：1,100日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>包裝×環保袋 L(皮克敏＆水果)：1,870日圓(含稅)</p></li><li><p>包裝×環保袋 S(皮克敏＆恰比)：1,540日圓(含稅)</p></li></ul><p>各周邊將於Nintendo TOKYO / OSAKA / KYOTO / FUKUOKA為首，全國的電視遊戲經銷店、雜貨經銷店、線上商店等陸續販售。<br/>此外，全國的FamilyMart也販售 設計有裝飾皮克敏的任天堂預付卡 。</p><h3>「皮克敏露台in宮島SA」舉辦貼紙贈送活動</h3><figure><img alt=\"原生生物貼紙4張套組\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"435\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c8910a91d1bd2e62d18cf56dc382625addaa9db2ebbec4022f636cb5c836c0b0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7ce5ca74490d8ba3fa5cf2a6374f6bec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>原生生物貼紙4張套組</figcaption></figure><p>自2026年11月14日(六)起，於「<a href=\"https://www.w-nexco.co.jp/lp/pikmin_miyajima/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皮克敏露台in宮島SA</a>」消費 5,000日圓(含稅)以上 ，即可獲得每月更換的「<strong>原生生物貼紙4張套組</strong>」。<br/>11月主題為「首先是大眾熟悉的！陸地上的原生生物」，預定每月配合主題推出各種原生生物。</p><figure><img alt=\"皮克敏露台出差所\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"903\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dc63465be7a16d11179a538f0788a056bb3d936539d7a807fc5fdbe4b380fb98/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe31e17ffb495c97ae92efa9fd96b3529.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>皮克敏露台出差所</figcaption></figure><p>同樣自11月14日(六)起，活動車巡迴宮島SA近鄰的「<strong>皮克敏露台出差所</strong>」也將開始。<br/>這是出差販售皮克敏露台商品，至今沒有機會造訪宮島SA的人也能利用。</p><h3>「Nintendo Music」追加「Pikmin Bloom」樂曲</h3><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>「Nintendo Switch Online」加入者向的音樂服務「Nintendo Music」追加「<strong>Pikmin Bloom</strong>」樂曲。<br/>平時不開聲音遊玩「Pikmin Bloom」的人，也是仔細聆聽BGM的機會。</p><h3>皮克敏的新圖示零件發布中</h3><figure><img alt=\"皮克敏的新圖示零件\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0afa3dd4e5194af3643f73da7241f5181aa02ec81a6b538bb304ec8ba705653b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3fb0b52d6d91675fc04b3de4d30d9626.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>皮克敏的新圖示零件</figcaption></figure><p>「Nintendo Switch Online」加入者可兌換的白金點數禮物，追加皮克敏的新<strong>圖示零件</strong>。<br/>至2026年11月29日(日) ，每週更換、連續4週發布。</p><p>詳情請參閱<a href=\"https://www.nintendo.com/jp/games/switch2/ampyc/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定」官方網站</a>。</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>作品概要</p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>名稱</p></td><td><p>皮克敏4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>平台</p></td><td><p>Nintendo Switch 2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>發售日</p></td><td><p>2026年11月12日(四)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>價格</p></td><td><p>下載版：7,500日圓(含稅)<br/>盒裝版：7,578日圓(含稅)<br/>升級通行證：1,000日圓(含稅)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>分級</p></td><td><p>CERO A(全年齡對象)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote><p></p><p>[トピックス]『ピクミン4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + だれでもチャレンジ! ダンドリ検定』は本日発売。小芝風花さんがダンドリ検定に挑む長編映像も公開中。<a href=\"https://t.co/PZc4jbdO8E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/PZc4jbdO8E</a></p><p>— 任天堂株式会社 (@Nintendo) <a href=\"https://x.com/Nintendo/status/2120686659893440619?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 12, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/moomin-mm/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「姆明：瘋狂夏日」發售！也正在舉辦9折上市特賣</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/metaphor-switch2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「暗喻幻想：ReFantazio」終於登上Nintendo Switch 2！以臺幣770或港幣187的新價格享受超名作奇幻RPG</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/the-legend-of-zelda-ocarina-of-time-remake-total-sales-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「薩爾達傳說 時之笛」發售4天內銷量達520萬套！創下任天堂Nintendo Switch 2遊戲發行史上最高紀錄</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/switch2-switch-update-ver-23-5-0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Nintendo Switch 2、Switch版本更新新增贈送軟體的「禮物」功能</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/super-mario-party-jamboree-nintendo-switch2-edition-update-nov2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《超級瑪利歐派對 空前盛會 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition ＋ 空前盛會 TV》推出免費更新！只需一份遊戲 最多4人同樂玩大富翁</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:03:51.205769+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2650,"images":20,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T21:58:00.020076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:28.098278+00:00","content_hash":"673c8db8e979abb83aec49b249f299ac889237b7699c47f48c56758ad8be1403","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}